---
// Decorative workflow illustration. The visible caption describes its purpose.
---

<figure class="relative mx-auto max-w-5xl">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="overflow-hidden rounded-panel border border-section-line bg-section-panel text-left shadow-panel">
    <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3 border-b border-section-line bg-material/70 px-4 py-3 sm:px-5">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <div class="hidden gap-1.5 sm:flex"><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-muted/35"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-muted/25"></span><span class="size-2.5 rounded-full bg-brand-muted/20"></span></div>
        <span class="text-xs font-medium text-brand-copy">orso <span class="mx-2 text-brand-muted">/</span> your-site</span>
      </div>
      <span class="flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-md border border-section-line bg-section-panel px-2 py-1 text-[0.625rem] text-brand-muted"><span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>All changes saved</span>
    </div>
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-[8rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)] lg:grid-cols-[9rem_minmax(0,1fr)_minmax(0,1fr)]">
      <div class="hidden border-r border-section-line bg-material/45 p-3 md:block">
        <p class="px-2 pb-4 pt-2 text-[0.625rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-muted">Workspace</p>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-2 rounded-md bg-action-bottom/10 px-2 py-2 text-xs font-medium text-brand-accent"><svg class="size-3.5" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"><path d="M4 2h6l3 3v9H4zM10 2v4h3" /></svg>Content</div>
        <p class="px-2 py-2.5 text-xs text-brand-muted">✧ <span class="ml-1">Agent</span></p>
        <p class="px-2 py-2.5 text-xs text-brand-muted">◷ <span class="ml-1">History</span></p>
        <div class="mt-5 border-t border-section-line pt-4"><p class="px-2 text-[0.625rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-muted">Collections</p><p class="mt-3 px-2 text-xs font-medium text-brand-foreground">Blog <span class="float-right text-brand-muted">3</span></p><p class="mt-3 px-2 text-xs text-brand-muted">Help docs</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hidden min-w-0 border-r border-section-line md:block">
        <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-section-line px-5 py-3 text-[0.6875rem] text-brand-muted"><span>Blog <span class="mx-1">/</span> Product launch</span><span>•••</span></div>
        <div class="p-5 lg:p-7">
          <p class="text-[0.625rem] font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-muted">Title</p>
          <p class="mt-2 rounded-lg border border-section-line bg-section-ink px-3 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium">Product launch announcement</p>
          <div class="mt-5 grid grid-cols-2 gap-3"><div><p class="text-[0.625rem] font-medium text-brand-muted">Publish date</p><p class="mt-2 rounded-md border border-section-line px-3 py-2 text-[0.6875rem] text-brand-copy">2026-10-24</p></div><div><p class="text-[0.625rem] font-medium text-brand-muted">Tags</p><p class="mt-2 rounded-md border border-section-line px-3 py-2 text-[0.6875rem] text-brand-accent">Product notes</p></div></div>
          <div class="mt-6 flex gap-4 border-y border-section-line py-2 text-xs text-brand-muted"><span class="font-bold">B</span><span class="italic">I</span><span>H₂</span><span>↗</span><span>≡</span></div>
          <p class="mt-5 text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight">Introducing our new release</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-brand-copy">Good ideas deserve a site that keeps up. A new post, a clearer headline, a small change that makes a difference.</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-xs leading-relaxed text-brand-copy">Make it yours. See the result. Keep moving.</p>
          <p class="mt-7 truncate font-mono text-[0.5625rem] text-brand-muted">src/content/blog/en/launch.md</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0 bg-material/65 p-4 lg:p-5">
        <div class="mb-3 flex items-center justify-between text-[0.6875rem] text-brand-muted"><span>Live preview</span><span class="text-brand-accent">↗ your-site.com</span></div>
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white text-neutral-900">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-neutral-100 px-5 py-3"><span class="text-xs font-semibold">Studio.</span><span class="text-[0.5625rem] text-neutral-500">Journal <span class="ml-3">About</span></span></div>
          <div class="p-5 lg:p-6">
            <p class="text-[0.5rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-action-edge">The journal / Product notes</p>
            <p class="mt-3 font-semibold text-3xl leading-[1.06] tracking-tight">Introducing our<br />new release.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-[0.625rem] leading-relaxed text-neutral-600">Good ideas deserve a site that keeps up.</p>
            <div class="relative mt-5 h-28 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-[#e9eeff] sm:h-32"><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-[12%] h-20 w-24 rounded-t-2xl bg-[#b2c5ff]"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-[40%] h-28 w-24 rounded-t-full bg-[#6f96f5]"></div><div class="absolute -right-1 bottom-0 h-16 w-28 rounded-tl-full bg-action-bottom"></div></div>
            <div class="mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-4 rounded-md bg-action-bottom px-3 py-2 text-[0.5625rem] font-medium text-white">Read the story <span>↗</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3 text-center text-[0.625rem] text-brand-muted">Your changes, right in front of you.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-section-line bg-material/50 px-4 py-2 text-[0.625rem] text-brand-muted"><span>⑂ main <span class="mx-2 text-brand-accent">+1 file</span></span><span>Markdown → your site</span></div>
  </div>
  <figcaption class="mt-4 text-center text-[0.6875rem] text-brand-muted">An illustration of the Orso workspace. Your content and your site, side by side.</figcaption>
</figure>
